PN,41701
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786535276
OL,3,CMuir reveals threat to shoot him
OL,4,Cfollowing culling of 51 cows
OL,6,FAgriculture Minister Andrew Muir said
OL,7,Fhe has received a threat that he will
OL,8,Fbe shot following controversy over the
OL,9,Fculling of 51 cows in Co Tyrone.
OL,11,FDuring an emergency meeting of
OL,12,FStormont's Agriculture Committee on
OL,13,FMonday, the minister was told that he
OL,14,Fhad "lost all credibility" and that
OL,15,Fhis department had presided over an
OL,16,F"animal welfare scandal" after the
OL,17,Fcows were shot in fields.
OL,26,@vD@EOUvD@ZO]xD@AOUxD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786535276
OL,3,CMuir reveals threat to shoot him
OL,4,Cfollowing culling of 51 cows
OL,6,FThe minister urged MLAs to temper
OL,7,Ftheir language after the committee
OL,8,Fheard a claim that the public believes
OL,9,Fthat there had been a "shoot to kill"
OL,10,Fapproach over the animals.
OL,12,FThe Department of Agriculture,
OL,13,FEnvironment and Rural Affairs' (Daera)
OL,14,FHumane Slaughter Team carried out the
OL,15,Fcull of the cattle on land near
OL,16,FFivemiletown in June.
OL,26,@qD@WOUqD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786535276
OL,3,CMuir reveals threat to shoot him
OL,4,Cfollowing culling of 51 cows
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised by some
OL,7,Fpolitical representatives and farmers
OL,8,Fabout the public nature of the
OL,9,Fincident and Mr Muir has ordered an
OL,10,Fexternal review of the circumstances.
OL,12,FWhile he appeared before the
OL,13,Fcommittee, scores of farmers held a
OL,14,Fprotest outside Parliament Buildings
OL,15,Fin Stormont.
OL,17,FThe cull took place following a court
OL,18,Forder requiring the department to act
OL,19,Fafter a man was convicted of a number
OL,20,Fof offences and disqualified for life
OL,21,Ffrom keeping animals.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786535276
OL,3,CMuir reveals threat to shoot him
OL,4,Cfollowing culling of 51 cows
OL,6,FThe minister has previously said there
OL,7,Fwas "no reasonable alternative" but to
OL,8,Fcomply with the court order by culling
OL,9,Fthe animals on the site.
OL,11,FMr Muir told the committee that
OL,12,Fanimals had been "essentially starving
OL,13,Fto death" on the farm.
OL,15,FHe told MLAs: "The case arose from
OL,16,Fnumerous welfare inspections carried
OL,17,Fout by Daera staff between January 20
OL,18,F2022 and January 30 2024.
OL,20,F"During these inspections, conditions
OL,21,Fon the farm were very poor.
OL,26,@oD@EOUoD@_O]tD@ROUuD@IO]wD@OOU|D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786535276
OL,3,CMuir reveals threat to shoot him
OL,4,Cfollowing culling of 51 cows
OL,6,F"The photos published included that of
OL,7,Femaciated animals (and) shall never
OL,8,Fleave my mind.
OL,10,F"The situation on this farm that led
OL,11,Fto the prosecutions was, frankly,
OL,12,Fgrotesque."
OL,14,FThe minister said limited animal feed
OL,15,Fon the site was "contaminated with
OL,16,Furine and dung".
OL,18,FHe added: "A large number of animals
OL,19,Fwere caused unnecessary suffering.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUtD@KO]wD@QOUxD@OO]zD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786535276
OL,3,CMuir reveals threat to shoot him
OL,4,Cfollowing culling of 51 cows
OL,6,F"Approximately 33 animal carcasses and
OL,7,Fanimal bones were found.
OL,9,F"The individual was rightly
OL,10,Fdisqualified for life from keeping,
OL,11,Fowning and participating in the
OL,12,Fkeeping of animals."
OL,14,FThe minister said he appreciated
OL,15,F"genuine and legitimate" concerns
OL,16,Fexpressed by members of the public
OL,17,Fover the operation to cull the cows.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@AOUtD@TO]wD@AOUwD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786535276
OL,3,CMuir reveals threat to shoot him
OL,4,Cfollowing culling of 51 cows
OL,6,FHe added: "I must address the very
OL,7,Freal impact of some of the misleading
OL,8,Fand inaccurate reporting and
OL,9,Fcommentary that has surrounded this
OL,10,Fcase.
OL,12,F"The wave of misogynistic, sectarian
OL,13,Fand homophobic hate, threats and
OL,14,Fintimidation against both officials
OL,15,Fand myself is despicable and deeply
OL,16,Fconcerning.
OL,18,F"The fact that I have now received a
OL,19,Fdeath threat is nothing short of a
OL,20,Fdisgrace."
OL,26,@nD@KOUtD@AOUzD@AOU|D@JO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786535276
OL,3,CMuir reveals threat to shoot him
OL,4,Cfollowing culling of 51 cows
OL,6,FHe added: "The fact that I have had to
OL,7,Fdiscuss this with the police and also
OL,8,Fofficials are having to consider
OL,9,Fsecurity measures and personal safety
OL,10,Fis unacceptable and seriously
OL,11,Ftroubling.
OL,13,F"The misogynistic, sectarian and
OL,14,Fhomophobic abuse does not reflect the
OL,15,Fmajority of farmers who are respectful
OL,16,Fand kind."
OL,26,@nD@KOUuD@AOUxD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786535276
OL,3,CMuir reveals threat to shoot him
OL,4,Cfollowing culling of 51 cows
OL,6,FDUP deputy leader Michelle McIlveen
OL,7,Fsaid: "As a consequence of this
OL,8,Foperation, your department has lost
OL,9,Fall credibility in the eyes of the
OL,10,Fpublic where animal welfare is
OL,11,Fconcerned, and that is really
OL,12,Fconcerning to me and should be
OL,13,Fconcerning to you.
OL,15,F"There is anger right across the
OL,16,Ffarming community, and the anger is
OL,17,Fcoming from decent, hardworking
OL,18,Ffarmers who are just trying to make a
OL,19,Fliving from the land.
OL,26,@oD@GOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41710
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786535276
OL,3,CMuir reveals threat to shoot him
OL,4,Cfollowing culling of 51 cows
OL,6,F"What happened appears to be brutal,
OL,7,Fappears to be inhumane, and
OL,8,Fironically, what was meant to be an
OL,9,Fanimal welfare intervention has become
OL,10,Fan animal welfare scandal at the hands
OL,11,Fof the department, and that's totally
OL,12,Fregrettable."
OL,14,FMs McIlveen asked the minister how he
OL,15,Fwould "retain and renew" confidence in
OL,16,Fhis department.
OL,18,FMr Muir said he recognised it was a
OL,19,F"sensitive and a deeply distressing
OL,20,Fcase" and said concerns raised would
OL,21,Fbe examined in the independent review.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@MO]wD@GOUwD@XO]{D@AOU|D@EO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41711
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786535276
OL,3,CMuir reveals threat to shoot him
OL,4,Cfollowing culling of 51 cows
OL,6,FHe said: "I think we all have a role
OL,7,Fin political life for leadership, in
OL,8,Ffacts and understanding that we need
OL,9,Fto give time and space for the review
OL,10,Fto do its work, and for that review to
OL,11,Fbe full and thorough, and for them to
OL,12,Fthen fully examine the findings and
OL,13,Frecommendations arising from this.
OL,15,F"I want to be really, really clear
OL,16,Fthat this case has been really, really
OL,17,Fdifficult, both for me and for
OL,18,Fofficials in the department, because
OL,19,Fthe animal welfare prosecution that
OL,20,Fled to the deprivation order were
OL,21,Fgrotesque scenes.
OL,26,@nD@JOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G11/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41712
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786535276
OL,3,CMuir reveals threat to shoot him
OL,4,Cfollowing culling of 51 cows
OL,6,F"We had carcasses piled up in the
OL,7,Ffarm. We had animal bones lying
OL,8,Faround. We had emaciated animals.
OL,10,F"I want to reassure everyone that the
OL,11,Fprofessional judgement of officials in
OL,12,Fmy department was very much that this
OL,13,Fwas a last resort.
OL,15,F"People were very distressed in terms
OL,16,Fof having to go there in regard to
OL,17,Fthis, and also very distressing some
OL,18,Fof the commentaries subsequent to it."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUwD@AOUzD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G12/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41713
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786535276
OL,3,CMuir reveals threat to shoot him
OL,4,Cfollowing culling of 51 cows
OL,6,FMs McIlveen said: "From the public's
OL,7,Fview, the primary focus didn't appear
OL,8,Fto be about the welfare of animals;
OL,9,Fthat it seemed to be rather than a
OL,10,Fnurture approach, that it was
OL,11,Fbasically a shoot-to-kill approach."
OL,13,FMr Muir said: "I would urge calm and
OL,14,Fpeople to temper their language around
OL,15,Fthis, because I've received threats
OL,16,Fand that someone wants me shot.
OL,18,F"So, we just need to lower the tone in
OL,19,Fthis. We have a responsibility in our
OL,20,Flanguage."
OL,26,@nD@SOUsD@dO]uD@OOUzD@AOU|D@JO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G13/14
